  "plain": "Brandon Fugal, the owner of Skinwalker Ranch, a Utah property known for reports of strange happenings, says that a reporter at the New York Post named Steven Greenstreet disputed his account of a briefing and made him out to be a liar. Fugal tells podcast host Jesse Michels that he answered by posting photos as proof, showing himself meeting with a Pentagon official named Sean Kirkpatrick. To Fugal, the photos show his side of the story was true."
